description	"Captain Cardinal

Crimson Armored CQC Instructor with rush down potential.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
-- Fast Movement
-- Cripples On Hit
- SE-44C Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 40% faster RoF
-- 15% more damage/FP damage
-- 100% slower reload
- F-11D Blaster Rifle (DC Carb 1)
-- 40% faster RoF
-- 35% less damage/FP damage
-- 30 Shot Clip
-- 40% slower mag reload
- Frag Grenade (1)
- Fire Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (2)
- Blast Armor
- Barge
- Knockdown Roll
- Melee Resist
- Healing (2)
- Stat Viewer
- Rally
- 10% more knockback given

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Instruct (Force/Resource Dispenser 2) ^3[USE In Melee]"